stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> loading: mount
    loading --> ready_valid: supported payload
    loading --> invalid_card_omitted: mixed kinds, retain valid cards
    invalid_card_omitted --> ready_valid: render only own supported kinds
    ready_valid --> loading: more page, deduplicate IDs
    loading --> unavailable_coverage: inherited or unknown coverage source
    ready_valid --> unavailable_coverage: invalid coverage, retain validated update
    unavailable_coverage --> retrying: Try again
    retrying --> ready_valid: supported response
    retrying --> unavailable_coverage: invalid response
    loading --> retired: session invalidated
    ready_valid --> retired: session invalidated
    unavailable_coverage --> retired: session invalidated
    retrying --> retired: session invalidated
    retired --> retired: ignore late response and refresh
    retired --> [*]: dispose
